            <row>
              <cell>Let $$p = -15.6:$$</cell>
              <cell>Is the quotient of $$-15.6$$ and $$-2.4$$ equal to $$6.5$$?</cell>
              <cell />
            </row>
            <row>
              <cell>Translate.</cell>
